WEBVTT

00:00:01.814 --> 00:00:03.575
This is Dream Brush.

00:00:04.788 --> 00:00:09.349
The system allows me to create a painting by writing Chinese characters with a brush.

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:13.192
I just wrote the character Shan, which means mountain.

00:00:13.682 --> 00:00:16.000
[Sound of rock bursting through the ground]

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:19.911
The system generates the painting based on the meaning of the character.

00:00:20.664 --> 00:00:24.103
It also generates a sound effect to announce the visual change.

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:28.472
I just wrote Yun, Hai, cloud, and ocean.

00:00:30.736 --> 00:00:32.600
[Air whooshing]

00:00:32.628 --> 00:00:37.029
The system can automatically separate individual characters from continuous writing.

00:00:39.432 --> 00:00:44.392
I just wrote Niao, Ri, bird and the sun.

00:00:45.648 --> 00:00:48.648
[Ocean wave crashing and splashing]

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:54.643
The brush allows me to control the size and the location of the generated element using my hand.

00:00:55.262 --> 00:00:57.161
[Crane calling]

00:00:57.734 --> 00:01:00.054
The output is positioned to match the writing.

00:01:01.643 --> 00:01:05.483
I wrote Xue, snow, on top of the existing mountain.

00:01:09.373 --> 00:01:10.972
[Rooster crowing]

00:01:12.852 --> 00:01:14.212
That's the sound of sunrise.

00:01:14.891 --> 00:01:18.569
Metaphorical sounds are generated to depict silent objects.

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:24.447
[Wind howling]
The system understood

00:01:24.762 --> 00:01:27.081
I'd like to change the weather for the entire painting.

00:01:32.754 --> 00:01:35.194
I just wrote Ye, which means night.

00:01:36.907 --> 00:01:38.907
[Cicada chirping]
